INSERT INTO "RecordDefinition" ("recordKey","engine","mount","pageFile","docCode","title","docRevisionStart","jobInfoGroup","clientHook","primaryBatchField","extraBatchFields","extraJson","version","updatedAt") VALUES ('abalone-packing-specification','monitoring-log','#mlRoot','REC-7.2.4-abalone-packing-specification.html','REC 7.2.4','Abalone Packing Specification',3,NULL,NULL,'jobNo',ARRAY[]::text[],'{"batchField":"jobNo","instructions":[{"label":"Packing specification calculation","text":"For each pcs / drained-weight line, enter the drained weight (X), the ingo weight (Y) and the customer min/max drained-weight spec. Cookout % and the new min/max ingo weights are worked out for you."},{"label":"Ingo weights","text":"Each confirmed calculation line is copied into the Ingo Weights table below, matched on pcs + drained weight. Sign a line off there once QC has checked it."},{"label":"Frequency","text":"On each new pack specification or customer spec change."}],"deriveInto":{"matchKeys":["pcs","drainedWeight"],"map":{"pcs":"pcs","drainedWeight":"drainedWeight","minIngo":"newMinIngo","maxIngo":"newMaxIngo"},"stampFields":{"dateEffective":"today"}},"secondaryLog":{"key":"ingo-weights","title":"Ingo Weights","deviationLabel":"Deviation","entryFields":[{"key":"dateEffective","label":"Date effective","type":"date","role":"date"},{"key":"pcs","label":"Pcs","type":"number"},{"key":"drainedWeight","label":"Drained weight","type":"number","unit":"g"},{"key":"minIngo","label":"Ingo weight - min","type":"number","unit":"g"},{"key":"maxIngo","label":"Ingo weight - max","type":"number","unit":"g"},{"key":"checkedBy","label":"Checked by (QC)","type":"text"},{"key":"checkedByDate","label":"Sign-off date","type":"date"},{"key":"comments","label":"Comments","type":"text","showInTable":false}]}}'::jsonb,COALESCE((SELECT "version" FROM _pv WHERE "recordKey"='abalone-packing-specification'),0)+1,now());
